  "spec": "Doc 08 FR-03/T-03 — consumer contracts for the events Doc 08 consumes durably (S08 step 3; ADR 0011: durable consumption ⇒ contract)",
  "note": "The keys Doc 08's RollupConsumer DEPENDS ON, per event. The ticket.* slices read ticket_id ONLY — the customer id comes from the ticket ROW (truth), never the payload. customer.merged/unmerged entries are those events' FIRST consumer contracts. Doc 07's projector consumption of customer.merged (T-03's list rewrite) joins at step 6 with its own entry. S08 step 8: Doc08/SearchIndexer joins — the seven catalog-declared customer.* feeds plus the ticket-family events that change a customer's SCOPE arrays; ticket.* slices read ticket_id ONLY (customer from the ticket ROW, the same law).",
